  [x] OPEN-45: `nfa_simulate("a+", …)` and `a|b` match/miss emit+gcc+run (`open_regex_alt: PASSED`). Not a compiled DFA. `[]` is residual.
  [x] OPEN-46: Org `std/` stays not product. Same emit+gcc+run bar as `ooda/std`.

### Type system depth
  [x] OPEN-47: Runtime `requires` / `ensures` emit to C `if` + exit. SMT is residual.
